Package: parkbingo
Title: Generate Randomized Bingo Cards for Walt Disney World Parks
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Brian", "Maitner", email = "bmaitner@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds randomized bingo cards for a day at Walt Disney World
    parks from a curated table of squares. Each square is tagged with a
    mode ('cynic' or 'fan'), age suitability ('child' or 'adult'), the parks
    where it applies, and an estimated probability of being crossed off.
    Cards can be filtered and difficulty-balanced, rendered to PDF, scored for
    their odds of a bingo, and difficulty estimates can be refined from
    player feedback. Not affiliated with or endorsed by The Walt Disney
    Company.
